{"text":"kuruntokai","n":322,"lines":["அமர்க்க ணாமான் அஞ்செவிக் குழவி","கானவ ரெடுப்ப வெரீஇ யினந்தீர்ந்து","கான நண்ணிய சிறுகுடிப் பட்டென","இளைய ரோம்ப மரீஇயவ ணயந்து","மனையுறை வாழ்க்கை வல்லி யாங்கு","மருவின் இனியவு முளவோ","செல்வாந் தோழி யொல்வாங்கு நடந்தே"],"tr":["amarkka ṇāmāṉ añcevik kuḻavi","kāṉava reṭuppa verīi yiṉantīrntu","kāṉa naṇṇiya ciṟukuṭip paṭṭeṉa","iḷaiya rōmpa marīiyava ṇayantu","maṉaiyuṟai vāḻkkai valli yāṅku","maruviṉ iṉiyavu muḷavō","celvān tōḻi yolvāṅku naṭantē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஐயூர் முடவனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Aiyūr Muṭavaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 24, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 15, veṇṭaḷai 9, kalittaḷai 2"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அமர்க்க","tr":"amarkka","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அமர்க்","tr":"amark"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]},{"text":"ணாமான்","tr":"ṇāmāṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணா","tr":"ṇā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மான்","tr":"māṉ"}]},{"text":"அஞ்செவிக்","tr":"añcevik","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அஞ்","tr":"añ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"செவிக்","tr":"cevik"}]},{"text":"குழவி","tr":"kuḻavi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குழ","tr":"kuḻa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வி","tr":"vi"}]}],[{"text":"கானவ","tr":"kāṉava","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னவ","tr":"ṉava"}]},{"text":"ரெடுப்ப","tr":"reṭuppa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரெடுப்","tr":"reṭup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]},{"text":"வெரீஇ","tr":"verīi","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வெரீ","tr":"verī"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"இ","tr":"i"}]},{"text":"யினந்தீர்ந்து","tr":"yiṉantīrntu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினந்","tr":"yiṉan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தீர்ந்","tr":"tīrn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"கான","tr":"kāṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"நண்ணிய","tr":"naṇṇiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நண்","tr":"naṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணிய","tr":"ṇiya"}]},{"text":"சிறுகுடிப்","tr":"ciṟukuṭip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குடிப்","tr":"kuṭip"}]},{"text":"பட்டென","tr":"paṭṭeṉa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பட்","tr":"paṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டென","tr":"ṭeṉa"}]}],[{"text":"இளைய","tr":"iḷaiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இளை","tr":"iḷai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"ரோம்ப","tr":"rōmpa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரோம்","tr":"rōm"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]},{"text":"மரீஇயவ","tr":"marīiyava","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரீ","tr":"marī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]},{"text":"ணயந்து","tr":"ṇayantu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணயந்","tr":"ṇayan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"மனையுறை","tr":"maṉaiyuṟai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மனை","tr":"maṉai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுறை","tr":"yuṟai"}]},{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","tr":"vāḻkkai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாழ்க்","tr":"vāḻk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]},{"text":"வல்லி","tr":"valli","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வல்","tr":"val"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லி","tr":"li"}]},{"text":"யாங்கு","tr":"yāṅku","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யாங்","tr":"yāṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]}],[{"text":"மருவின்","tr":"maruviṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரு","tr":"maru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வின்","tr":"viṉ"}]},{"text":"இனியவு","tr":"iṉiyavu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இனி","tr":"iṉi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யவு","tr":"yavu"}]},{"text":"முளவோ","tr":"muḷavō","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முள","tr":"muḷa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வோ","tr":"vō"}]}],[{"text":"செல்வாந்","tr":"celvān","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செல்","tr":"cel"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாந்","tr":"vān"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"யொல்வாங்கு","tr":"yolvāṅku","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யொல்","tr":"yol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாங்","tr":"vāṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]},{"text":"நடந்தே","tr":"naṭantē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நடந்","tr":"naṭan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அமர்க்கண்","parts":[{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"amar","gloss":"beautiful"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"eye"}],"gloss":"beautiful-eyed"},{"surface":"ஆமான்","parts":[{"text":"ஆமான்","lemma":"āmāṉ","gloss":"wild cow"}],"gloss":"wild cow"},{"surface":"அஞ்செவி","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"am","gloss":"beautiful"},{"text":"செவி","lemma":"cevi","gloss":"ear"}],"gloss":"beautiful-eared"},{"surface":"குழவி","parts":[{"text":"குழவி","lemma":"kuḻavi","gloss":"calf"}],"gloss":"calf"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கானவர்","parts":[{"text":"கானவர்","lemma":"kāṉavar","gloss":"forest dwellers"}],"gloss":"forest dwellers"},{"surface":"எடுப்ப","parts":[{"text":"எடுப்ப","lemma":"eṭu","gloss":"when chased"}],"gloss":"when they chased"},{"surface":"வெரீஇ","parts":[{"text":"வெரீஇ","lemma":"veruvu","gloss":"having feared"}],"gloss":"having feared"},{"surface":"இனந்தீர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"iṉam","gloss":"herd"},{"text":"தீர்ந்து","lemma":"tīr","gloss":"having separated"}],"gloss":"having separated from the herd"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கான","parts":[{"text":"கான","lemma":"கான","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"forest","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நண்ணிய","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணிய","lemma":"naṇ","gloss":"which is close to"}],"gloss":"which is close to"},{"surface":"சிறுகுடி","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"ciṟu","gloss":"small"},{"text":"குடி","lemma":"kuṭi","gloss":"hamlet"}],"gloss":"small hamlet"},{"surface":"பட்டென","parts":[{"text":"பட்டு","lemma":"paṭu","gloss":"having entered"},{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"as"}],"gloss":"as it entered"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இளையர்","parts":[{"text":"இளையர்","lemma":"iḷaiyar","gloss":"young ones"}],"gloss":"young ones"},{"surface":"ஓம்ப","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்ப","lemma":"ōmpu","gloss":"to cherish"}],"gloss":"to cherish"},{"surface":"மரீஇ","parts":[{"text":"மரீஇ","lemma":"maruvu","gloss":"having become accustomed"}],"gloss":"having become accustomed"},{"surface":"அவண்","parts":[{"text":"அவண்","lemma":"avaṇ","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"நயந்து","parts":[{"text":"நயந்து","lemma":"nayam","gloss":"lovingly"}],"gloss":"lovingly"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மனையுறை","parts":[{"text":"மனை","lemma":"maṉai","gloss":"house"},{"text":"உறை","lemma":"uṟai","gloss":"dwelling"}],"gloss":"house-dwelling"},{"surface":"வாழ்க்கை","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்க்கை","lemma":"vāḻkkai","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"},{"surface":"வல்லியாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"வல்லி","lemma":"val","gloss":"having adapted"},{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"āṅku","gloss":"like that"}],"gloss":"just as it adapted"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மருவின்","parts":[{"text":"மருவு","lemma":"maruvu","gloss":"to become familiar"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"if"}],"gloss":"if one becomes familiar"},{"surface":"இனியவும்","parts":[{"text":"இனிய","lemma":"iṉiya","gloss":"sweet things"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even sweeter things"},{"surface":"உளவோ","parts":[{"text":"உள","lemma":"uḷa","gloss":"are there"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"question particle"}],"gloss":"are there?"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செல்வாம்","parts":[{"text":"செல்","lemma":"cel","gloss":"go"},{"text":"வாம்","lemma":"vām","gloss":"we will"}],"gloss":"we shall go"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"ஒல்வாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்","lemma":"ol","gloss":"fitting"},{"text":"வாங்கு","lemma":"vāṅku","gloss":"manner"}],"gloss":"gently"},{"surface":"நடந்தே","parts":[{"text":"நடந்து","lemma":"naṭantu","gloss":"walking"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"by walking"}]}],"literal":"The beautiful-eyed wild cow's beautiful-eared calf, / when forest dwellers chased, having feared and separated from the herd, / as it entered the small hamlet close to the forest, / when the young ones cherished it, having become accustomed, lovingly there, / just as it adapted to the house-dwelling life, / if one becomes familiar, are there even sweeter things? / We shall go, O friend, walking in a fitting manner.","translation":"The beautiful-eared calf of a beautiful-eyed wild cow, frightened when chased by forest dwellers, got separated from its herd and entered a small hamlet near the forest. When the young children there cherished and protected it, it grew accustomed to that place, lovingly adapting to a domestic life. If one becomes familiar with a place, is there anything sweeter? Let us go, my friend, walking gently.","modern":"அழகிய கண்களை உடைய காட்டுப் பசுவின் அழகிய காதுகளை உடைய கன்று, கானவர்கள் துரத்தியபோது அஞ்சித் தன் கூட்டத்தை விட்டுப் பிரிந்தது. அது காட்டை அடுத்த சிறு குடியிருப்புக்குள் புகுந்தது. அங்குள்ள சிறுவர்கள் அதனை அன்போடு வளர்க்க, அது அந்த வீட்டிலேயே தங்கி வாழப் பழகிக் கொண்டது. அதுபோல, அன்பு காட்டிப் பழகிவிட்டால் அதைவிட இனிய விஷயம் வேறு ஏதேனும் உண்டோ? தோழியே! நாம் தகுந்தவாறு மெல்ல நடந்து அவரோடு செல்வோம்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her close friend when they are about to elope. The friend is deeply worried about how the delicate heroine will survive the journey and adapt to a completely new, unfamiliar environment. Reassuring her, the heroine uses a beautiful mountain landscape image of a wild cow's calf. Though born in the wild forest, the calf gets separated from its herd, enters a human hamlet, and easily adapts to a domestic life because of the love and care shown by the local children. The heroine implies that just like the wild calf, she too will easily adapt to her new life with her lover because of their mutual love. The key phrase 'maruviṉ iṉiyavu muḷavō' highlights that once familiarity and love are established, everything becomes sweet.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}